 # Aegis Golden Path (v1)
 
+## Enterprise hardening + multimodal contracts patch
+
+This patch addresses four gaps:
+
+### A) Observability / perception (expanded)
+- OTel trace ingestion endpoint:
+  - POST `/v1/otel/v1/traces` (stores trace markers for correlation)
+- Robust SLO error-rate decisioning from PromQL:
+  - GET `/v1/slo/error-rate`
+- Drift monitoring as first-class signals:
+  - POST `/v1/drift/check` -> persists `drift_signals` records
+
+### B) Approvals workflow polish
+- Approvals now support:
+  - expiration (`expires_at`)
+  - N-person approval (`required_approvals`, `approvals[]`)
+  - notifications stub (Slack webhook optional)
+
+Env:
+- `AEGIS_APPROVAL_EXPIRES_MIN=60`
+- `AEGIS_APPROVAL_REQUIRED_COUNT=2` (for prod)
+- `AEGIS_SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=...` (optional)
+
+### C) Infra landing zone (more production defaults)
+- Advanced Terraform scaffold upgraded with:
+  - production-default variables for multi-AZ nodegroups
+  - additional Karpenter wiring placeholders
+
+### D) Multimodality (first-class contracts)
+- Adds a multimodal chat contract endpoint:
+  - POST `/v1/openai/mm/chat/completions`
+  - normalizes content parts (text + image_url + base64 image) to upstream-friendly format
+
+Migrations:
+```bash
+alembic upgrade head
+```
+
